  m_text: "The year is 2500. Humanity has expanded across the Solar System and invented
    revolutionary technologies including futuristic spaceships, debris-to-fuel conversion,
    and artificial wormholes for teleportation.\n \nThe long-awaited, first-ever
    Apollo Olympics is set to debut; however, a massive buildup of space junk and
    plundering space pirates have impeded interplanetary travel.\n\nUnlike the ancient
    Olympics, this legendary competition is not only a challenge of speed, but a
    daring mission of ingenuity and survival. Pilots must select the ultimate spaceship,
    scavenge space debris to fuel their abilities, navigate through deadly asteroids,
    defeat relentless pirates, and race across the Solar System.\n\nDo you have the
    skill, the courage, and the determination to become the greatest space racer
    of all?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 560c7af368c9d4675993f0d038fbc4c1, type: 2}
