  m_text: 'The Apollo Olympics consists of two parts: Space Junk Collection and Space
    Race. In Space Junk Collection, collect space junk to earn the credits needed
    to enter a race. In Space Race, race through eight levels of increasing distance
    and difficulty to the edge of the Solar System. Throughout the Olympics, maneuver
    through asteroids and roll to confuse space pirates. Make sure to read the customization
    information carefully to select your ideal spaceship. Good luck and see you at
    the finish line!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 560c7af368c9d4675993f0d038fbc4c1, type: 2}
